<title>PERU: Peru's Fujimori rules out using force in crisis.</title>
<headline>Peru's Fujimori rules out using force in crisis.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peruvian President Alberto Fujimori ruled out on Saturday the use of force to resolve the ongoing hostage crisis.</p>
<p>&quot;The possibility of using force by the state is ruled out,&quot; Fujmori said in a message to the nation.  </p>
<p>It was his first public address since the hostage crisis began last Tuesday.</p>
</text>
